[{"id": "BK003", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK000", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK002", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": false, "reps": 1, "out": "وعليكم السلام.\n\nأحتاج توضيح: هل تقصد الدكتور أحمد المختص في تقويم الأسنان؟\n\n(معلومات المواعيد والأطباء قيد التحديث حالياً، وسأقوم بتحويل طلبك للفريق المختص بعد التأكيد)"}, {"id": "BK004", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK001", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": false, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK006", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": false, "reps": 1, "out": "Hello! I'd be happy to help you with booking a filling (حشو).\n\nI need to let you know that our booking information is currently being updated in our system. I'll escalate your request to our staff to check availability with Dr. Ahmed for tomorrow at 10:00 AM.\n\nCould you please provide:\n- Your full n"}, {"id": "BK007", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK008", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK009", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": false, "reps": 1, "out": "Hello! I'd be happy to help you with teeth whitening.\n\nHowever, I need to let you know that our booking information is currently being updated, and I cannot confirm availability, doctors, or time slots at this moment. \n\nPlease contact our clinic directly so our staff can assist you with scheduling a"}, {"id": "BK010", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK011", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK013", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK014", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK015", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK016", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps": 1, "out": ""}, {"id": "BK018", "cat": "booking-clear", "pass": true, "reps